            <title>[LU-15560] Interop: conf-sanity test 125 fails due to ‘libtool: command not found’</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-15560</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;conf-sanity test_125 started failing with ‘test_125 failed with 1’ on March 6, 2021 for 2.14.50.130 servers and 2.12.6 clients at  &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/84da2d25-f8e9-4cb9-866b-64a9eed672a0" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/84da2d25-f8e9-4cb9-866b-64a9eed672a0&lt;/a&gt; . On September 25, 2021, the error message changed to ‘test_125 returned 1’ for 2.14.54.92 servers and 2.12.7 clients at  &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/3bca7cdf-65d7-4562-8ff4-d5698d725761" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/3bca7cdf-65d7-4562-8ff4-d5698d725761&lt;/a&gt; . &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The error message we see in all of the suite_log  is&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;CMD: trevis-78vm3 libtool execute l_tunedisk /dev/mapper/ost1_flakey
trevis-78vm3: sh: libtool: command not found
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Although the timelines don’t match up, the failure to find libtool is most likely related to changes in &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/40253" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/40253&lt;/a&gt; landed to master on January 22 2021.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This test fails 100% of the time for interop testing. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For recent failures see:&lt;br/&gt;
2.14.0.21 servers and 2.12.7 clients - &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/3ee61e14-5cc9-487f-9c2c-bb1cdd1f7bfd" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/3ee61e14-5cc9-487f-9c2c-bb1cdd1f7bfd&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
2.15.0.RC2 servers and 2.12.7 clients - &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/22ac659a-68d8-45b2-86bf-af05113ec932" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/22ac659a-68d8-45b2-86bf-af05113ec932&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
